{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12308480","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12308480","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230848001:1":{"text":"나보고 땀 냄새 풍기는 사람들이랑 섞여서 일하라는 말이야?","source_cn":"你是说要我和那群满身臭汗的人混在一起工作？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8FD2C6300EA56E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230848002:1":{"text":"그들에 비하면 나에게는 나만의 방법이 있어.","source_cn":"相比于他们，我有自己的方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x226C919A1AD65761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230848003:1":{"text":"잘 관찰하고 만남의 기회를 활용하면 조만간 지나가는 업타운 사람의 눈에 띄게 되겠지.","source_cn":"只要我注意观察，抓住邂逅的机会，我迟早会被路过的上城区...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x154F057E402358AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230848004:1":{"text":"나의 변신에는 노동은 필요 없어. 미모만 있으면 충분하다고!","source_cn":"我的蜕变不需要劳动，靠美貌就够了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4058E12350C1BA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:居民特里丝":{"text":"트리스","source":"居民特里丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}